WEBVTT

00:00:10.960 --> 00:00:15.720
<i>Truly loving myself</i>

00:00:10.960 --> 00:00:15.720
<i>boku ga boku wo aishinuku koto</i>

00:00:15.890 --> 00:00:20.140
<i>Is it alright to still believe in that?</i>

00:00:15.890 --> 00:00:20.140
<i>naa mada shinjitemo iika?</i>

00:00:20.310 --> 00:00:23.940
<i>No matter where this journey takes us</i>

00:00:20.310 --> 00:00:23.940
<i>doko e mukau tabi datoshitemo</i>

00:00:32.780 --> 00:00:36.110
<i>Since when was it?</i>

00:00:32.780 --> 00:00:36.110
<i>are itsukarada?</i>

00:00:36.280 --> 00:00:39.030
<i>Being honest became whining</i>

00:00:36.280 --> 00:00:39.030
<i>honne ga yowane ni nattana</i>

00:00:39.200 --> 00:00:41.580
<i>Standing firm became strength</i>

00:00:39.200 --> 00:00:41.580
<i>nigenai koto ga tsuyosa ni natta</i>

00:00:41.750 --> 00:00:44.870
<i>Have you found it yet?</i>

00:00:41.750 --> 00:00:44.870
<i>naa mitsukaranai?</i>

00:00:45.040 --> 00:00:49.250
<i>Not confidence, your true self</i>

00:00:45.040 --> 00:00:49.250
<i>jishin janaku jibun jishin</i>

00:00:50.550 --> 00:00:54.760
<i>There must be something
I've forgotten that I still haven't found</i>

00:00:50.550 --> 00:00:54.760
<i>kitto mada sagasetenai wasuremono ga aruhazu</i>

00:00:54.930 --> 00:00:59.100
<i>Words I want to say
That I still haven't said</i>

00:00:54.930 --> 00:00:59.100
<i>zutto mada tsutaetenai tsutaetai kotoba</i>

00:00:59.260 --> 00:01:04.430
<i>If you would watch me, I'd captivate you</i>

00:00:59.260 --> 00:01:04.430
<i>mitete kurerunara misete miserunoni</i>

00:01:04.600 --> 00:01:09.440
<i>Truly loving myself</i>

00:01:04.600 --> 00:01:09.440
<i>boku ga boku wo aishinuku koto</i>

00:01:09.610 --> 00:01:13.610
<i>Is it alright to still believe in that?</i>

00:01:09.610 --> 00:01:13.610
<i>naa mada shinjitemo iika?</i>

00:01:13.780 --> 00:01:17.660
<i>I smolder because I've actually burned</i>

00:01:13.780 --> 00:01:17.660
<i>kusuburuno wa chanto moeta karada</i>

00:01:17.820 --> 00:01:22.740
<i>No matter where this journey takes us</i>

00:01:17.820 --> 00:01:22.740
<i>doko e mukau tabi datoshitemo</i>

00:01:22.910 --> 00:01:27.710
<i>I'll just open my eyes</i>

00:01:22.910 --> 00:01:27.710
<i>tada me wo mihiraite</i>

00:01:27.870 --> 00:01:31.460
<i>And dream my dream</i>

00:01:27.870 --> 00:01:31.460
<i>yume wo miru</i>

00:01:31.630 --> 00:01:33.800
<i>And know my dream</i>

00:01:31.630 --> 00:01:33.800
<i>yume wo shiru</i>

00:01:42.180 --> 00:01:50.480
WE'RE THE BEAST KING COMMANDOS

00:01:50.650 --> 00:01:53.690
Medroa!

00:02:00.530 --> 00:02:01.620
We win!

00:02:02.830 --> 00:02:05.200
Wow! Very impressive, Popp!

00:02:05.370 --> 00:02:08.500
You wiped out
those powerful enemies all at once!

00:02:09.000 --> 00:02:12.540
Couldn't have done it
without your new attack, Big Guy.

00:02:12.920 --> 00:02:16.970
It seems there was a spell
that not even Orichalcum can withstand.

00:02:19.720 --> 00:02:20.550
What's wrong?!

00:02:20.720 --> 00:02:21.970
What is it, Hyunckel?!

00:02:22.140 --> 00:02:25.220
Keep your guard up!
Something's still there!

00:02:29.440 --> 00:02:30.100
What?!

00:02:35.400 --> 00:02:36.150
It can't be!

00:02:39.530 --> 00:02:40.530
That's...

00:02:42.950 --> 00:02:43.910
impossible!

00:02:44.080 --> 00:02:45.120
They survived!

00:02:45.990 --> 00:02:49.710
How?! Nothing could survive
a Medroa spell unscathed!

00:02:49.870 --> 00:02:54.090
That was close.
They've got a pretty nasty Mage with them.

00:03:03.140 --> 00:03:05.180
Block! Are you okay?!

00:03:05.350 --> 00:03:06.180
Back there...

00:03:06.350 --> 00:03:12.980
<i>if Block hadn't fallen on us
to push us into the ground...</i>

00:03:13.480 --> 00:03:16.440
all five of us would have died.

00:03:16.610 --> 00:03:18.440
Thanks, Block.

00:03:18.610 --> 00:03:21.860
You're a lot sharper than you look.

00:03:23.780 --> 00:03:26.240
I-It's the optimal way to dodge.

00:03:26.410 --> 00:03:31.540
And you wouldn't even think of it, unless
you were willing to sacrifice yourself!

00:03:31.710 --> 00:03:34.250
Even I have to admit
that was pretty brave!

00:03:34.420 --> 00:03:37.630
It looks like even
the evil can use teamwork.

00:03:37.800 --> 00:03:43.010
The value of using individual strengths
to compensate for weaknesses...

00:03:43.430 --> 00:03:46.260
is something we know all too well.

00:03:46.720 --> 00:03:50.680
We already knew we'd be fighting
powerful enemies!

00:03:50.850 --> 00:03:57.070
No matter who they are, all we can do
is fight on together, right?!

00:03:57.230 --> 00:03:58.020
Everyone!

00:03:58.360 --> 00:04:00.030
Exactly.

00:04:00.610 --> 00:04:01.570
I guess so.

00:04:01.740 --> 00:04:05.410
We're hardly nimble enough
to keep pace with our enemies.

00:04:06.530 --> 00:04:10.000
Okay, let's pull ourselves together
and deal the finishing blow!

00:04:10.160 --> 00:04:11.750
That won't happen.

00:04:11.910 --> 00:04:12.750
Sigma?!

00:04:18.750 --> 00:04:23.470
This Mirror of Shahal
will not break even if I die.

00:04:23.630 --> 00:04:29.680
It's a legendary item Lord Hadlar
granted me, not a part of my body.

00:04:31.350 --> 00:04:33.600
That was quite an impressive spell.

00:04:33.770 --> 00:04:39.110
But now that we've seen it,
it won't work on the Royal Guard again.

00:04:41.900 --> 00:04:45.110
Let's get on with round two!

00:04:46.200 --> 00:04:46.990
Hym.

00:04:47.530 --> 00:04:49.450
Block needs healing first.

00:04:49.620 --> 00:04:51.330
And our mission is to...

00:04:51.500 --> 00:04:54.080
Who cares?! I'm done with that, Albinass!

00:04:54.580 --> 00:04:57.290
Nothing can stop me
once I'm this fired up!

00:04:57.460 --> 00:05:00.300
I'll avenge Block, too, so don't worry!

00:05:00.460 --> 00:05:02.170
<i>That's enough, Hym.</i>

00:05:05.130 --> 00:05:08.760
<i>Not that I dislike
that personality of yours...</i>

00:05:08.930 --> 00:05:12.220
<i>but don't make things
difficult for Albinass.</i>

00:05:13.230 --> 00:05:14.680
It's you!

00:05:19.440 --> 00:05:20.860
Lord Hadlar!

00:05:21.730 --> 00:05:22.940
There he is!

00:05:23.110 --> 00:05:23.860
Hadlar!

00:05:25.070 --> 00:05:26.070
Dai.

00:05:26.610 --> 00:05:27.530
Wait!

00:05:31.870 --> 00:05:33.290
It's just an illusion!

00:05:33.450 --> 00:05:36.790
An illusion?! Then he's not really here?!

00:05:37.290 --> 00:05:38.250
That's correct.

00:05:38.630 --> 00:05:44.170
This is just a magical projection.
The real me is in the Field of Death.

00:05:44.340 --> 00:05:47.840
So you sit back and let your servants
do your dirty work?

00:05:48.010 --> 00:05:52.140
I guess the rumors that you'd grown
as a warrior were just a lie, Hadlar!

00:05:52.760 --> 00:05:58.810
I never intended to defeat you through
an ambush, nor did I believe I could.

00:05:58.980 --> 00:06:02.980
We were content waiting for you
in the Field of Death.

00:06:03.150 --> 00:06:06.570
But then the other humans
decided to meddle.

00:06:06.740 --> 00:06:07.240
Huh?!

00:06:07.400 --> 00:06:08.610
What are you talking about?!

00:06:08.780 --> 00:06:13.160
I told you! The Royal Guard
protects the Field of Death!

00:06:13.330 --> 00:06:17.040
We would accept
your challenge there fair and square!

00:06:17.210 --> 00:06:22.880
But then we learned the other humans
intended to invade the Field of Death.

00:06:23.040 --> 00:06:25.840
We came to weed out the unworthy.

00:06:26.010 --> 00:06:26.590
Weed out?!

00:06:26.760 --> 00:06:31.930
On Lord Hadlar's orders,
we came to test all of you!

00:06:32.100 --> 00:06:38.180
Basically, anyone not standing now is
unworthy of entering the Field of Death!

00:06:40.440 --> 00:06:43.400
Dai, you and your friends are all we want.

00:06:43.570 --> 00:06:48.570
I won't have the Dark King's presence
soiled by the blood of the unworthy.

00:06:48.740 --> 00:06:50.610
I'll be waiting!

00:06:51.030 --> 00:06:54.200
Come to the Field of Death at once!

00:06:54.370 --> 00:06:55.120
Wait!

00:07:00.250 --> 00:07:01.170
And with that,

00:07:01.330 --> 00:07:03.630
we shall take our leave.

00:07:03.790 --> 00:07:08.130
Seeing your strengths
made our time well spent.

00:07:08.300 --> 00:07:11.090
Come when you will. We shall welcome you.

00:07:11.260 --> 00:07:12.220
Farewell.

00:07:16.470 --> 00:07:18.890
I want the Hero, but I want you even more.

00:07:19.060 --> 00:07:23.730
Hyunckel, was it?
I'll be paying you back for this.

00:07:23.900 --> 00:07:27.650
But Lord Hadlar's orders must be obeyed!

00:07:27.820 --> 00:07:32.030
I'll be praying that
he orders me to kill you.

00:07:35.780 --> 00:07:37.950
Get back here!
Screw you and your weeding out!

00:07:38.120 --> 00:07:41.040
Popp! Don't make the same mistake!

00:07:41.210 --> 00:07:41.830
Huh?!

00:07:42.000 --> 00:07:42.870
Oh, right.

00:07:43.040 --> 00:07:45.250
We need to tend to everybody first!

00:07:45.420 --> 00:07:48.710
We need more help!
Dai and Popp, get Leona and the others!

00:07:48.880 --> 00:07:49.920
Got it!

00:07:54.260 --> 00:07:56.470
We have done as you commanded.

00:07:56.640 --> 00:07:57.930
Well done.

00:07:58.100 --> 00:08:03.560
Lord Hadlar, Hym, Sigma, and Block
require regeneration.

00:08:03.730 --> 00:08:04.730
Very well.

00:08:05.230 --> 00:08:06.360
As do you.

00:08:06.520 --> 00:08:08.530
It's just a scratch.

00:08:09.570 --> 00:08:12.200
I see you took quite a beating.

00:08:12.360 --> 00:08:13.740
What did you think of them?

00:08:13.910 --> 00:08:17.160
I like them. They make worthy opponents.

00:08:18.280 --> 00:08:20.120
Where is Fenbren?

00:08:20.290 --> 00:08:24.170
A rat has entered the Field of Death.

00:08:24.500 --> 00:08:26.920
It had to be dealt with.

00:08:29.960 --> 00:08:32.340
You know your mission, Troop Number Three!

00:08:39.180 --> 00:08:40.310
Okay!

00:08:48.440 --> 00:08:50.820
I see a suspicious light!

00:08:52.320 --> 00:08:55.660
What is this? It's just Popp's staff.

00:08:55.820 --> 00:08:59.120
He must have lost it in the last fight.

00:08:59.280 --> 00:09:01.040
I guess I'll take it to him.

00:09:01.200 --> 00:09:03.870
Even he might feel some gratitude.

00:09:11.380 --> 00:09:15.760
I see. So there's nothing
but bare mountains.

00:09:15.930 --> 00:09:21.010
Yet when you fly over the mountains,
a mysterious force blocks you?

00:09:23.270 --> 00:09:26.440
I guess recruiting Seari
was the right idea.

00:09:27.440 --> 00:09:32.190
It's a Seaslime I recruited on the shore.
It's Troop Number Three.

00:09:33.650 --> 00:09:36.240
Huh? Uh, sure! I-I won easily!

00:09:36.400 --> 00:09:40.240
It's not very strong, but I figured
we could use it as a scout.

00:09:40.410 --> 00:09:41.740
You know?!

00:09:44.410 --> 00:09:47.120
It's searching the ocean floor
for an entrance.

00:09:47.290 --> 00:09:49.420
If there isn't one above ground, then...

00:09:49.580 --> 00:09:51.880
Very good instincts, little one.

00:09:53.670 --> 00:09:56.880
You're the Dark Army!
One of the Orichalcum enemies!

00:09:57.050 --> 00:10:00.850
Indeed. I am the bishop of
the Hadlar Royal Guard...

00:10:01.010 --> 00:10:02.810
Fenbren.

00:10:05.890 --> 00:10:08.480
BLOODY SCRYDE

00:10:10.940 --> 00:10:13.480
ULTRA COMBUSTION SLASH

00:11:03.240 --> 00:11:04.030
Seari?!

00:11:05.240 --> 00:11:08.250
What?! A giant gate under the ocean?!

00:11:08.870 --> 00:11:12.500
I see! That entrance must lead
to the Dark King!

00:11:12.670 --> 00:11:14.670
So it really was underwater!

00:11:14.840 --> 00:11:20.760
Hey, Dark Army! The Beast King Commandos
have found the entrance to your base!

00:11:20.930 --> 00:11:22.390
How do you like that?!

00:11:23.640 --> 00:11:27.430
Oh my. So you've seen
the Dark Citadel Gate.

00:11:27.720 --> 00:11:28.980
The Dark Citadel Gate?!

00:11:29.140 --> 00:11:31.980
That's the giant underwater gate.

00:11:32.150 --> 00:11:38.690
It's the only entrance to Vearn Palace,
Dark King Vearn's Great Dark Citadel.

00:11:38.860 --> 00:11:41.610
The Great Dark Citadel, Vearn Palace?!

00:11:53.500 --> 00:11:57.000
You messed up! Thanks for the information!

00:11:57.170 --> 00:12:01.300
Once we return to Dai
and tell him what we know,

00:12:01.470 --> 00:12:05.090
they'll launch a full-scale attack
on Vearn Palace!

00:12:05.260 --> 00:12:07.810
Look forward to it!

00:12:07.970 --> 00:12:13.690
Sadly, little one,
your little scheme has three flaws.

00:12:14.690 --> 00:12:19.150
The first is assuming
that you can leave this island!

00:12:30.370 --> 00:12:32.750
Wind...? A Woosh spell?

00:12:32.910 --> 00:12:36.750
Indeed. I have mastered
all Vortex-type spells.

00:12:36.920 --> 00:12:41.510
I can incapacitate anyone around me
and make quick work of them.

00:12:41.670 --> 00:12:43.010
Dammit!

00:12:43.880 --> 00:12:47.470
The second flaw is in entering
the Great Dark Citadel.

00:12:47.640 --> 00:12:50.720
This is an impossibility for any and all.

00:12:50.890 --> 00:12:56.480
The Dark Citadel Gate has been sealed by
the Dark King's Supercharged Dark Magic.

00:12:56.650 --> 00:13:01.030
It's a legendary gate
that hasn't opened in centuries.

00:13:01.190 --> 00:13:02.740
That makes no sense!

00:13:02.900 --> 00:13:05.610
Then how do you get in and out of it?!

00:13:05.780 --> 00:13:09.950
We are warriors of the Dark Army,
bestowed with a special enchantment.

00:13:10.120 --> 00:13:12.790
It allows us to enter and exit
with Zoom spells.

00:13:12.950 --> 00:13:16.620
For an outsider
to pry open the gate and enter

00:13:16.790 --> 00:13:20.380
would be impossible, no matter
what great power they wield.

00:13:20.550 --> 00:13:26.380
You're saying no one can get to
the Dark King no matter how hard they try?

00:13:26.550 --> 00:13:29.300
Not even a Dragon Knight could.

00:13:29.470 --> 00:13:31.720
You lie! I don't believe that!

00:13:32.100 --> 00:13:35.640
It doesn't really matter what you believe.

00:13:35.810 --> 00:13:37.770
Your third and final flaw,

00:13:37.940 --> 00:13:41.020
is assuming Dai will hear any of this.

00:13:41.190 --> 00:13:41.730
Huh?

00:13:41.900 --> 00:13:45.530
Because you are going to die here!

00:13:45.820 --> 00:13:49.530
All Dai is going to see is your corpses!

00:14:11.800 --> 00:14:12.600
Seari!

00:14:15.730 --> 00:14:16.600
Worm!

00:14:18.640 --> 00:14:20.310
Know your place!

00:14:21.810 --> 00:14:24.610
Rattus Rocket Ram!

00:14:38.330 --> 00:14:44.130
Fool. My body is almost entirely blades,
yet you flung yourself into me.

00:14:44.300 --> 00:14:48.260
And you shredded yourself
just to save this little worm.

00:14:50.640 --> 00:14:52.220
Sh-Shut up!

00:14:53.720 --> 00:14:57.890
They may look like worms to you...

00:14:58.980 --> 00:15:01.900
but they're the first followers
I've ever had!

00:15:02.360 --> 00:15:06.440
They're all proud members of my troop!

00:15:06.780 --> 00:15:09.780
I'm... their captain!

00:15:10.660 --> 00:15:14.620
A captain protects his troops
with his life!

00:15:21.250 --> 00:15:25.040
Well said. You're braver than any rat.

00:15:25.210 --> 00:15:29.420
You make me want
to see you grovel for your life.

00:15:29.590 --> 00:15:31.590
Huh? What?!

00:15:31.760 --> 00:15:37.390
The other Royal Guard members
are all chivalrous warriors.

00:15:37.560 --> 00:15:39.310
But not me.

00:15:39.480 --> 00:15:44.980
I keep in line so as
not to disrupt the order, but...

00:15:45.150 --> 00:15:48.570
I... am very cruel.

00:15:52.860 --> 00:15:55.370
Hurry! Get him some help!

00:16:06.420 --> 00:16:10.170
Th-This is...!
What a sad state of affairs!

00:16:10.340 --> 00:16:11.840
Wait! Where's our army?!

00:16:12.010 --> 00:16:16.430
What were our invincible
Bengarna elite warriors doing?!

00:16:18.310 --> 00:16:22.100
When the dock was attacked,
they were the first to go down.

00:16:23.140 --> 00:16:25.060
They're probably still in...

00:16:25.230 --> 00:16:27.900
What?!

00:16:30.440 --> 00:16:32.150
Nova, are you okay?!

00:16:35.240 --> 00:16:36.120
Dai...

00:16:36.280 --> 00:16:38.490
Thank goodness! You need healing!

00:16:38.830 --> 00:16:39.950
Forget it.

00:16:40.950 --> 00:16:44.330
I can't... move a single muscle.

00:16:44.500 --> 00:16:46.420
I'm just dead weight.

00:16:46.580 --> 00:16:49.550
I can't bear to be seen like this.

00:16:50.210 --> 00:16:53.970
Consider it a mercy, and just leave me.

00:16:54.550 --> 00:16:56.010
W-What are you...?!

00:16:57.090 --> 00:16:59.760
Ow, ow, ow, ow! What was that for?!

00:16:59.930 --> 00:17:02.060
See? You can still stand.

00:17:02.680 --> 00:17:06.440
It's your stupid pride that's
sapping your energy to stand up.

00:17:07.810 --> 00:17:14.280
There are many wounded here who are
weaker than you yet fought harder!

00:17:14.450 --> 00:17:17.950
If you can stand, then go back
to the base on your own two feet!

00:17:18.120 --> 00:17:21.370
Or would you like me to carry you?

00:17:25.250 --> 00:17:27.250
I'll carry the wounded.

00:17:30.500 --> 00:17:35.470
Whoever marries Maam
is in for quite a handful.

00:17:36.550 --> 00:17:40.600
<i>That's the pot calling
the kettle black, Leona.</i>

00:17:41.100 --> 00:17:42.600
Hey!

00:17:42.970 --> 00:17:46.390
It's no good. We can't find Chiu anywhere.

00:17:46.770 --> 00:17:50.570
Gomechan's missing, too.
It looks like they really went ahead.

00:17:50.730 --> 00:17:53.400
What?! So they went
to the Field of Death?!

00:17:53.570 --> 00:17:58.860
Sorry. If I knew he'd do this, I wouldn't
have given him the Beast King Flute.

00:17:59.370 --> 00:18:03.410
He probably recruited
a flying monster and flew there.

00:18:03.580 --> 00:18:07.500
He probably intends to scout,
but the enemy's too dangerous.

00:18:07.670 --> 00:18:09.290
I'll use a Zoom spell and go get him.

00:18:09.460 --> 00:18:11.540
Hyunckel and I will be backup.

00:18:11.710 --> 00:18:13.340
Glad to have you.

00:18:13.500 --> 00:18:14.380
I'll go, too.

00:18:14.550 --> 00:18:15.920
Stay here, Dai.

00:18:16.090 --> 00:18:18.880
It's temporary,
but we'll be splitting our forces.

00:18:19.050 --> 00:18:21.800
You and Maam should
protect everybody here.

00:18:22.260 --> 00:18:23.260
All right.

00:18:23.430 --> 00:18:24.390
Popp.

00:18:24.810 --> 00:18:27.520
Once you find Chiu, come straight back!

00:18:27.690 --> 00:18:31.730
We've lost our ship, so we need
to regroup and form a new plan.

00:18:32.360 --> 00:18:34.440
Fighting can come later.

00:18:34.610 --> 00:18:37.530
Aye-aye. I'm well aware of that.

00:18:37.700 --> 00:18:41.820
"Never make the same mistake twice"
is the Popp motto!

00:18:42.580 --> 00:18:45.240
We'll be off. Look after things here.

00:18:45.410 --> 00:18:46.870
Take care, you three.

00:18:55.880 --> 00:18:57.260
You're quite resilient.

00:18:57.800 --> 00:19:00.930
You're tougher than I thought.

00:19:01.430 --> 00:19:06.140
A rat... shows its true strength...
when it's cornered!

00:19:09.600 --> 00:19:11.480
And now it's over.

00:19:13.230 --> 00:19:15.940
Don't... worry!

00:19:16.530 --> 00:19:18.490
I-I promise...

00:19:18.650 --> 00:19:22.530
I promise I'll get you all out of here!

00:19:25.370 --> 00:19:28.370
This barely even tickles!

00:19:49.730 --> 00:19:53.270
I doubt I'll ever meet anyone
this steadfast again!

00:20:17.460 --> 00:20:18.630
Gomechan!

00:20:18.800 --> 00:20:22.340
W-What was that blow?!

00:20:25.050 --> 00:20:26.890
What?!

00:20:27.680 --> 00:20:29.600
Impossible! This is impossible!

00:20:29.770 --> 00:20:32.730
My body is made of Orichalcum!

00:20:32.890 --> 00:20:37.110
That little Slime put a dent in me?!

00:20:37.270 --> 00:20:39.650
Inconceivable! Impossible!

00:20:41.400 --> 00:20:46.570
No matter how it happened,
I must end its life immediately.

00:20:46.740 --> 00:20:48.780
Not only is this worm creepy,

00:20:48.950 --> 00:20:55.040
but it goes and damages my face,
a crime worthy of death!

00:21:00.460 --> 00:21:03.050
You won't touch Troop Number Two!

00:21:03.340 --> 00:21:04.050
Move!

00:21:08.970 --> 00:21:10.890
You troublesome rat.

00:21:11.060 --> 00:21:14.890
You can both be impaled together!

00:21:20.110 --> 00:21:22.490
Wh-Who's there?!

00:21:22.650 --> 00:21:23.610
Who are you?!

00:21:24.070 --> 00:21:26.700
What an ugly sight.

00:21:27.620 --> 00:21:31.080
The strong bullying the weak...

00:21:31.660 --> 00:21:34.660
I never realized how ugly it was
until I saw someone else do it.

00:21:34.830 --> 00:21:35.830
What?!

00:21:38.170 --> 00:21:39.500
Begone from here.

00:21:39.670 --> 00:21:43.300
Otherwise you'll lose more than your eyes.

00:21:45.340 --> 00:21:47.930
I don't know who you are,
but remember this!

00:21:48.090 --> 00:21:50.300
I promise you'll pay for this!

00:22:04.320 --> 00:22:07.280
<i>Even if you face the devil
With logic on your side</i>

00:22:04.320 --> 00:22:07.280
<i>tatoe akuma ni seiron kazashite
mukatte mitemo</i>

00:22:07.450 --> 00:22:11.240
<i>It may just be a rationalization</i>

00:22:07.450 --> 00:22:11.240
<i>sore wa akumade seitouka
sashite chigai wa naikamo</i>

00:22:11.410 --> 00:22:15.330
<i>Even now, even now I waver</i>

00:22:11.410 --> 00:22:15.330
<i>ima mo ima mo yureteiru kedo</i>

00:22:15.500 --> 00:22:19.380
<i>How far will we go?</i>

00:22:15.500 --> 00:22:19.380
<i>bokura wa dokomade yukuno</i>

00:22:19.540 --> 00:22:22.670
<i>I heard a voice like an angel's whisper</i>

00:22:19.540 --> 00:22:22.670
<i>tenshi no sasayaki nimo nita
koe ga kikoeta</i>

00:22:22.840 --> 00:22:26.590
<i>Maybe it was an imposter's illusion
It still rang in my ears</i>

00:22:22.840 --> 00:22:26.590
<i>hatamata petenshi no mayakashi
hitokiwa mimi ni hibiiteita</i>

00:22:26.760 --> 00:22:30.300
<i>Exposed to love and sorrow</i>

00:22:26.760 --> 00:22:30.300
<i>ai ni hiai ni sarasare nagara</i>

00:22:30.470 --> 00:22:34.600
<i>On the path strewn with pride</i>

00:22:30.470 --> 00:22:34.600
<i>hokori mamire michi no tochu</i>

00:22:36.310 --> 00:22:38.640
<i>Fleeting moments of cowardice</i>

00:22:36.310 --> 00:22:38.640
<i>kiete wa ukabu touhikou</i>

00:22:40.190 --> 00:22:42.440
<i>The SOS I held back</i>

00:22:40.190 --> 00:22:42.440
<i>nomikonda SOS</i>

00:22:44.020 --> 00:22:48.030
<i>I clenched my trembling fist</i>

00:22:44.020 --> 00:22:48.030
<i>furueru te wo nigirishimeta</i>

00:22:48.610 --> 00:22:53.620
<i>That single little promise</i>

00:22:48.610 --> 00:22:53.620
<i>tatta hitotsu no chiisana yakusoku ga</i>

00:22:53.780 --> 00:22:57.410
<i>Those trivial little memories</i>

00:22:53.780 --> 00:22:57.410
<i>honno sasaina omoidetachi ga</i>

00:22:57.580 --> 00:22:59.710
<i>They're still in my heart</i>

00:22:57.580 --> 00:22:59.710
<i>itsumade tattemo kono mune wo</i>

00:22:59.870 --> 00:23:03.880
<i>As embers that keep me burning</i>

00:22:59.870 --> 00:23:03.880
<i>kogashi tsuzukeru tomoshibi ni naru</i>

00:23:04.040 --> 00:23:08.380
<i>A single transparent beam of light</i>

00:23:04.040 --> 00:23:08.380
<i>tada hitosuji no toumei na hikari ga</i>

00:23:08.550 --> 00:23:11.550
<i>Lights the way before me</i>

00:23:08.550 --> 00:23:11.550
<i>me no mae wo terashite yuku</i>

00:23:11.720 --> 00:23:16.220
<i>There is little that I can do</i>

00:23:11.720 --> 00:23:16.220
<i>boku ni dekiru koto wa ikutsu mo naisa</i>

00:23:16.390 --> 00:23:22.440
<i>Just keep on to the future
I managed to grasp through my faith</i>

00:23:16.390 --> 00:23:22.440
<i>shinjinuita saki ni te ni shita mirai wo
susunde yuke</i>

00:23:34.070 --> 00:23:38.790
<i>Popp, Hyunckel, and Crocodine enter
the Field of Death searching for Chiu.</i>

00:23:38.950 --> 00:23:42.790
<i>There they find Dai's father,
Dragon Master General Baran.</i>

00:23:42.960 --> 00:23:48.760
<i>Upon learning of Baran's new goal,
Hyunckel and Crocodine try to stop him.</i>

00:23:48.920 --> 00:23:52.840
<i>That's when they realize
there's something different about him.</i>

00:23:53.010 --> 00:23:55.470
DRAGON QUEST The Adventure of Dai<i>,</i>

00:23:55.640 --> 00:23:57.770
<i>"The Avan Style Ultimate Technique"</i>

00:23:57.930 --> 00:23:59.850
<i>The adventure continues!</i>
